cept of brain training.\nOnline battles were possible, and progress could be saved on magnetic cards for continued play.\nOnline service was discontinued on September 1, 2010, and the battle function is no longer available.\nThe game was developed under the supervision of Tohoku University professor Ryuta Kawashima.", "themes": [{"id": 34, "name": "Educational"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/minna-de-kitaeru-zen-nou-training", "videos": [{"id": 158602, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "aWkOOE8Gihs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aWkOOE8Gihs", "title": "\u307f\u3093\u306a\u3067\u935b\u3048\u308b\u5168\u8133\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u3000 \u30e9\u30a4\u30f3\u64ae\u308a\u304a\u8a66\u3057", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aWkOOE8Gihs/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}